{title: 066 - God Be With You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #066 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 66}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D/A]God [F#m]be [Bm]with you [Em]till we meet [A7/G]again;
[D/F#]By His counsels [A]guide, uphold you,
[A]With His [C#/G#]sheep [G#dim]securely [D/A]fold [A]you:
[Bm]God be with [Em/B]you [A7/G]till we [G]meet [A]again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D/A]God [F#m]be [Bm]with you [Em]till we meet [A7/G]again;
[D/F#]Neath His wings [Bm]securely [A]hide you,
[A]Daily [C#/G#]manna [D/A]still [A]provide you:
[Bm]God be with [Em/B]you [A7/G]till we [G]meet [A]again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D/A]God [F#m]be [Bm]with you [Em]till we meet [A7/G]again;
[D/F#]When life's [Bm]perils [A]thick confound you,
[A]Put His [C#/G#]arms [G#dim]unfailing [D/A]round [A]you:
[Bm]God be with [Em/B]you [A7/G]till we [G]meet [A]again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D/A]God [F#m]be [Bm]with you [Em]till we meet [A7/G]again;
[D/F#]Keep love's [Bm]banner [A]floating o'er you,
[A]Smite death's [C#/G#]threatening [D/A]wave [A]before you:
[Bm]God be with [Em/B]you [A7/G]till we [G]meet [A]again.
{end_of_verse}
